WEBVTT

00:00:00.636 --> 00:00:04.236
Once Stingmon and XBmon DNA digivolved to form Paildamon,

00:00:04.336 --> 00:00:06.536
Okuamon was defeated so easily,

00:00:06.636 --> 00:00:09.636
we figured no one would ever stand a chance against us again.

00:00:09.736 --> 00:00:11.036
But we'd better be careful.

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:13.336
Arukinemon swore she'd get even with us.

00:00:13.436 --> 00:00:16.336
Ken's crest of kindness helped us get out of a few jams already,

00:00:16.436 --> 00:00:18.736
but I'm not so sure our new friendship would last.

00:00:18.836 --> 00:00:22.036
Ken seems to feel guilty about all the things he did as the Digimon Emperor,

00:00:22.136 --> 00:00:23.836
but I don't think feeling guilty is enough.

00:00:23.936 --> 00:00:26.636
Davis wants us all to be friends, but I don't think I can do it.

00:00:26.736 --> 00:00:29.036
I hope we don't need him to defeat Arukinemon.

00:01:28.316 --> 00:01:29.776
Trollspires get to date with me.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.460
By the way, Kari's the only one eligible.

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:39.590
THE LASER SHOT AND HORN TAIL

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:57.350
Guys, I think my dad could use you on his bowling team.

00:01:57.690 --> 00:01:59.770
Here you go, junk food from the vending machines.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.740
Candy bars, potato chips, and cheese crackers.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:02.500
Bon appétit!

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:05.840
Come on, guys, take it easy.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:06.940
You'll get a stomachache.

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:08.160
Check this out.

00:02:08.352 --> 00:02:09.192
What's up?

00:02:09.192 --> 00:02:11.952
Another control spire just went down in the digital world.

00:02:11.952 --> 00:02:13.892
Looks like Ken is working overtime.

00:02:13.892 --> 00:02:15.992
Hey, guess who's ready for his second course?

00:02:17.092 --> 00:02:18.352
You never told us what it was like

00:02:18.352 --> 00:02:20.192
when you DNA digivalped with worm on.

00:02:20.192 --> 00:02:21.332
It was weird.

00:02:21.468 --> 00:02:24.268
I felt like an action star in one of those big movies.

00:02:24.528 --> 00:02:27.768
Was it kind of like when you first digivolved from Wookie to Chappie and Digimom?

00:02:27.988 --> 00:02:29.228
No, bigger than that.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.910
me out the most though would be to have two minds in one body it's strange it didn't feel like two

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:41.310
minds in the same body it's more like our minds merged into one super being sounds weird to me

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:44.870
you already have enough voices running around in your head yeah i'll merge with you like a

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.260
get lost in there with the others.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:48.340
I was wondering how weird the DNA digivolve

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.320
was for Demi Vemon.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.660
It certainly was strange for me.

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.160
Well, you two are connected.

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:53.200
Yeah.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.170
Are you telling me that you and Ken

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:56.470
were somehow connected, too?

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:57.130
That's right.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:57.730
Pretty cool.

00:02:58.130 --> 00:02:59.760
I could even feel Ken's heart.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.500
meeting right along with mine.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.920
It was kind of freaky, to be honest.

00:03:04.412 --> 00:03:06.452
So you two were actually synchronized then.

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:09.180
You mean like those goofy swimmers in the Olympics?

00:03:09.184 --> 00:03:13.244
No. She means that your hearts were beating at the exact same time, silly.

00:03:15.284 --> 00:03:17.324
I knew that, Cody. I was just kidding.

00:03:17.624 --> 00:03:21.284
I'm telling you, just when we think we've got this whole Digivolution thing figured out,

00:03:21.344 --> 00:03:24.444
something new pops up. But this is the craziest thing we've seen yet.

00:03:25.148 --> 00:03:25.648
Just...

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:28.200
Think, if all the Digimon could Digivolve together,

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.000
just imagine all the weird and crazy

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.800
combinations. Let's see.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:34.100
If X-Vemon and Andromon combined,

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.320
they'd make one tough-winged Digimon, that's

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.560
