00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:44.920
X-Vemon and Aquilom?

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.040
Or even X-V-mon and Ankylomon.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:47.440
Ahh!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:52.930
