00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.910
And I see it as a way to defeat Arukenimon!

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.810
I'm not so sure. Might be dangerous.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.000
You're so stubborn sometimes, Cody!

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.780
Are you two finished being macho?

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.080
Hey, TK, check out DemiVimon. I think he's learned a new battle cry.

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:25.430
