00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:29.970
You s—

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:34.200
seem distracted, Ken. I've just been thinking a lot about the DNA Digivolve, and I'm worried

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.880
about the after effects. I mean, it does give you the power of an ultimate Digimon, but at what

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:42.430
price? It could be draining your powers and shortening your lifespan. But Ken, I didn't feel

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:47.030
any side effects when I Digivolved with XVmon, though it did feel weird to have only two legs.

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:53.260
I don't know. It's just a theory now. I don't have any proof to speak of yet. Okay, if you don't want

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:57.620
me to Digivolve with them, I just won't do it. But do you really have a theory about Digivolving,

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:59.980
or does it have more to do with hanging out with the other digi-

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:08.540
destined he might be right i'm just not sure yet i know it's late you don't fool me ken you're

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:12.680
really just nervous about being with the others you still haven't forgiven yourself i gotta get

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:15.740
home my parents must be worried sick about me they probably think i've disappeared again

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:20.060
hurry up worm on it's getting dark and i don't want to be a digi delicacy for some forest creature

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:29.620
wait for me it's amazing how fast you can move when you have the right motivation look at what

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:34.220
Deviants have done to my precious control spires. They think they've got the best of me, huh?

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:39.680
Wait till I get my hands on them. They may have set my plans back a bit, but there's no way I'll be defeated by some

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:46.080
Digi-Destined Pipsqueaks. I just have to be a little craftier next time. Look, they've knocked down the towers like a row of dominoes.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:52.740
So they want to play games, huh? We'll play all right, but by my rules, I'll show those brats who's boss. Huh?

