We smashed all the control spires in this area

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:29.850
How dare you talk about me like I'm some kind of witch I dressed this way to make a fashion statement

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:34.480
I think I'll call some friends of mine and ask them to teach those other rats a lesson in manners.

