00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.440
We're going to have to face her sooner or later, Kari.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:48.460
At least this way, it won't be a big surprise.

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:49.940
Hurry, we don't have much time.

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:51.520
Digi, bro!

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:57.230
Okay, we're all set. Now we all agree if it's too dangerous, we just turn back?

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:58.170
Let's go!

00:06:59.290 --> 00:06:59.970
I have a...

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.370
My question, who is the big person that lives in it?

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:18.440
This is Giga House?

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:20.060
It's huge and spacious.

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:21.860
