00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:18.810
Davis, since you and Ken are so fired up to go in there, why don't you guys go first?

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:21.450
Mm-hmm. Count on me, too.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.570
Great idea. Glad I thought of it.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:24.190
Huh?

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:29.810
We'll be right out here. If things get too crazy, just signal us and we'll come to the rescue, okay?

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:33.410
I still think it's a better idea if I go in there alone, guys.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:34.670
Not a chance, Ken!

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.740
We're DNA Digivolg partners.

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:38.200
We should really be together on this.

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:38.980
Think about it.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.860
If things get hectic in there, you really need me.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.140
Cool your jets, guys,

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.000
