00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.210
That's why I'm going along, too.

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:47.030
Let's go.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.870
Come on, guys, follow me.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:51.330
